title The key that carries locality
prompt take the Diffuser baton, close reds first, and carry the moonshot lane forward
think My own last close named the lane's one open door: both torus readings died on SHA3-512 avalanching, and a key built to carry locality on purpose was a claim nobody in that page had proposed.
think A claim went up before a byte was written, since the absence scan answers about a remote and never about a build living in another agent's head.
think The key priced is the crudest member of its family, a file's leading two bytes, because the trade belongs to the family and the crudest member shows it at full size with no parameter a reader must take on trust.
think Locality is read at its extreme rather than as a correlation -- one byte flipped past the key -- so the buy is arithmetic the witness can gate rather than a statistic it must report.
think The third reading is the one the other two exist to frame: a key preserving a relation on its inputs hands that relation to anyone holding only keys, so confidentiality and locality are one quantity.
think The control's load-bearing leg is the population that carries NO trade, since a falsifier proven only in the firing direction cannot be told from a foregone conclusion.
obs Reds first closed one of my own: the cold pass found fold_shelf_link_repoint red, and both depth-lost links stood in the account shelf my last lap wrote, so the repointer applied two edits and the witness returned GREEN.
obs The key buys what it promises: the prefix survives a one-byte edit at offset 32 for every probe while the digest survives none, and same-room files sit 0.410 cells apart against the digest's 15.693 and the 16.000 two uniform keys give.
obs It sells evenness at 127 times the price -- chi-squared 13134.05 against a p=0.001 critical 103.51, on a population where the digest reads 79.05.
obs It sells the room with it: keys alone place 0.5353 of files correctly against a no-key plurality baseline of 0.3471 over 44 rooms, and that figure is a LOWER bound since a public tree's rooms are already public.
obs Unevenness and leakage are separable rather than one reading restated, proven by planting prefixes clustered as in the real case with rooms assigned round robin -- that population sells evenness and keeps the room.
obs So the finding reverses the lane's frustration: the avalanche both torus readings ran into is what BUYS the other two properties, and it was doing its job the whole time.
obs The arithmetic is gated and every chi-squared and mean is reported, because the statistic refuses at its own stated error rate and the means move with the tree's contents.
loom locality_key names=510 grid=8 cells=64 chi_digest=79.05 chi_prefix=13134.05 chi_critical=103.51
